meta {
  name: List of All Patient Record Requests
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2/requests
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~offset: 8224.076751309922
  ~limit: 8224.076751309922
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Returns all patient record requests in Predoc. Returned request and reference identifiers can be used to correlate requests and retrieve the corresponding patient information.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `offset` | Paging offset. |
  | `limit` | Max number of records in the response. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
